    "description": {
      "content": [
        {
          "attrs": {
            "localId": "cef64340a5ac"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "When job has an error and error message is 500 characters and more then the ReportingEventHandler builds 17 parameters for ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "code"
                }
              ],
              "text": "TASK REPORT EXTENDED",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": " event. But the limit is only 16. As a result, Metrics SDK throws an exception the the Dispatcher fails to send and warning log should be written ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "code"
                }
              ],
              "text": "Failed to emit task {TaskId} extended report event.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "attrs": {
            "localId": "99ab2b10e7db"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "In such a case the main ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "code"
                }
              ],
              "text": "TASK REPORT",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": " event is published.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "attrs": {
            "localId": "c71149ea24a5"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "It is proposed to fix the issue by removing for extension evention ",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "attrs": {
            "localId": "6a76bb37a32d"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "code"
                }
              ],
              "text": "metricsBuilder.AddErrorContextIfTaskFailed(task);",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "attrs": {
            "localId": "fd80b22adbd2"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "strong"
                }
              ],
              "text": "Testing note: if there is no an easy way to creare a job error with 500 symbols message, then it is possible to reproduce the issue with E2E tests.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "attrs": {
            "localId": "fd80b22adbd2"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "strong"
                }
              ],
              "text": "Site Name:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "  (production site where the actual problem has happened) ",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "attrs": {
            "localId": "0cbf28805208"
          },
